      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for noting this point.\nOn testing, port was getting updated fine because of HOOK_BATTERY_SOC_CHANGE, but missed this.\nHOOK_POWER_SUPPLY_CHANGE is the right hook for port updation correctly.\nBut HOOK_AC_CHANGE is relevant for quick AC removal , as it gets called faster than \nHOOK_POWER_SUPPLY_CHANGE.",
